# data/raw is downloads, caches and regenerable research (about 42 MB).
# Everything in it stays local, except the three files below, which were written
# by hand and can't be rebuilt by the scripts.
data/raw/*
!data/raw/interactivity_map.json
!data/raw/engine_changes.md
!data/raw/wiki_manual_abilities.json
